  <History Date="25-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (P/T speed charts have range conflicts and PixFX RGBW19 channels don't make sense.  no product image available)" />
  <History Date="16-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised patt sel static display range." />
  <History Date="16-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added '1st' prefix to existing and added '2nd' modes (note 2 channels called 'Ring Foreground Shutter')" />
  <History Date="23-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Renamed first pattern mode function from on to off and corrected dynamic typo in response to manufacturer bug report." />
  <History Date="23-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail" />
